recommend keep-going both hands of the carry now stand proven; next agent-doable is a persistence rung (a kept payload beaded into a bounded content-addressed store, the firmware's flash) or the recorder/inbox meeting a Skate/glass surface — all Season-A, no custody gate until a board or provisioning is reached
